        "wild": "Equus magnus is a large prehistoric horse that roams the Island's open plains. It is skittish and will bolt from threats, but once a survivor manages to mount one and calm it through feeding, it becomes an incredibly loyal companion. They live in small herds and are constantly vigilant for predators.",
        "domesticated": "The Equus is a versatile and beloved mount. Its saddle functions as a mobile Mortar and Pestle, and it can be equipped with a lasso for capturing smaller creatures. It is one of the fastest land mounts and has excellent stamina for long journeys. The Equus can be ridden without a saddle at first, making it one of the more accessible early mounts."
